      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: I'm hoping they do add the concept of Tags/flags, and use that in conjunction with whatever playermods equivalent they develop, and allow more complex and interesting elements to worlds.  I would love that for like Giant models being able to move a little faster, pick up things, etc.  Due to having like a \"Giant\" tag or something.  Or maybe a way to sense the height of a player and adjust speed accordingly with a few algorythms.  If Player[height] >= Player2[height]\n  {Allow.grab = true}\n\nSomething along those lines.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
